     "<div dir=\"rtl\"><div><br>On Thursday, August 13, 2015 at 7:37:24 AM UTC+3, Gilad Twig wrote:</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;padding-left:1ex;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">שלום לכולם,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">אני משתמש חדש של </span><span dir=\"LTR\">R</span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> שמעוניין לבנות גרף עם\r\nעקומות  של </span><span dir=\"LTR\">survival</span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> שכולל גם </span><span dir=\"LTR\">confidence interval</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">בניתי  את הגרף ללא </span><span dir=\"LTR\">confidence\r\ninterval</span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> <span lang=\"HE\">והכל בסדר אבל כאשר אני מוסיף את</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">    </span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"background:yellow\" dir=\"LTR\"><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span>= TRUE</span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span style=\"background:yellow;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> </span><span style=\"background:yellow\" dir=\"LTR\"><a href=\"http://conf.int\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conf.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497234822000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RZUAEiWFNVeR-ZxFve8Tz\">conf.int</a></span><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">בהגדרות\r\nשל ה- </span><span dir=\"LTR\">plot </span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span>  כדי\r\nשיתן אל ה-</span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span> confidence intervals</span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> <span lang=\"HE\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">כל הגרף\r\nמתבלגן </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">אשמח\r\nלקבל רעיונות, </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">תודה\r\nמראש !!!</span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span dir=\"LTR\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl\" dir=\"RTL\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">להלו התוכנית בה השתמשתי</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" dir=\"RTL\">#####</span>Adjusted survival curve<span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" dir=\"RTL\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span>#####</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">coxmodel &lt;- coxph(Surv(Follow, CVD==1)~ Age_BMI + Birth_yr + GenderR +\r\nstrata(BMI7grR), data=Data1, method=&quot;breslow&quot;)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">cox &lt;- survfit(coxmodel)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">windows(width=7, height=7); par(lwd=1, las=1, family=&quot;sans&quot;,\r\ncex=1, mgp=c(2.5,1,0))</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">len &lt;- nchar(&quot;BMI7grR&quot;)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">group.levels &lt;- substring(names(cox$strata[cox$strata&gt;0]), len+2)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\"> plot(cox, col=1:32, lty=1, lwd=1,\r\nbty=&quot;l&quot;, mark.time=FALSE, ylim=c(0.98,1), xlab=&quot;Follow&quot;,\r\nylab=&quot;Probability&quot;, <span style=\"background:yellow\"><a href=\"http://conf.int\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conf.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497234822000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RZUAEiWFNVeR-ZxFve8Tz\">conf.int</a>= TRUE</span>)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">legend(&quot;topright&quot;, group.levels, title=&quot;BMI7grR&quot;,\r\ncol=1:32, lty=1, lwd=1, box.lty=0)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">title(&quot;Survival curve adjusted for Age_BMI + Birth_yr +\r\nGenderR&quot;)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-bottom:0pt\">summary(cox)</p></div></blockquote></div>"
